<title>SWEDEN: Atlas Copco says bids for U.S. company.</title>
<headline>Atlas Copco says bids for U.S. company.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish industrial engineering group Atlas Copco said on Monday that it had made a bid for a U.S. listed company.</p>
<p>Atlas Copco said in a statement that details of the bid would be released at a news conference at 0800 GMT on Monday.</p>
<p>On Friday Atlas Copco shares closed at 209.5 crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-700 1017</p>
</text>
